                    "description": "Automatically adds or modifies the date, date_modified, author, editor, revision and taxonomy.author to frontmatter when a page is saved via the Grav Admin Plugin. Optionally adds Twig variable users which contains data from user accounts.",
                    "description_html": "<p>Automatically adds or modifies the date, date_modified, author, editor, revision and taxonomy.author to frontmatter when a page is saved via the Grav Admin Plugin. Optionally adds Twig variable users which contains data from user accounts.</p>",
