                        "1.4.1": {
                            "date": "05/18/2020",
                            "content": "1. [](#bugfix)\n    * Fixed conflict with the new parent page explorer [#19](https://github.com/sojimaxi/grav-plugin-widget/issues/19).\n    * Fixed the folder regex pattern and apply it to only modular pages within the widgets parent folder.\n"
                        },
                        "1.4.0": {
                            "date": "05/18/2020",
                            "content": "1. [](#new)\n    * Added Inherited widgets for subpage from parent pages [#18](https://github.com/sojimaxi/grav-plugin-widget/issues/18)\n1. [](#improved)\n    * Improved widget loading performance with a static cache of already processed widgets\n"
