                        },
                        "1.1.5": {
                            "date": "09/12/2017",
                            "content": "1. [](#bugfix)\n    * Fix Twig runtime error Github issues [#7](https://github.com/sojimaxi/grav-plugin-widget/issues/7) & [#8](https://github.com/sojimaxi/grav-plugin-widget/issues/8)\n"
