                            "content": "1. [](#new)\n    * Added an overview video to README.md\n1. [](#improved)\n    * Type checking hooks\n"
                        },
                        "1.3.3": {
                            "date": "07/30/2016",
                            "content": "1. [](#bugfix)\n    * Pass a string to scanBlueprints instead of an array\n"
