                        },
                        "2.3.0": {
                            "date": "02/06/2019",
                            "content": "1. [](#bugfix)\n    * Resoled issue with fixed height of `Accordion` shortcode [#20](https://github.com/getgrav/grav-plugin-shortcode-ui/issues/20)\n    * PHP 7.2 Fix for `AnimatedText` shortcode \n"
                        },
                        "2.2.5": {
                            "date": "05/16/2017",
                            "content": "1. [](#bugfix)\n    * Resoled issue with fixed height of accordion [#20](https://github.com/getgrav/grav-plugin-shortcode-ui/issues/20)\n"
                        },
                        "2.2.4": {
                            "date": "04/25/2017",
                            "content": "1. [](#improved)\n    * Added the ability to set `class=\"\"` on the `ui-callout` shortcode [#19](https://github.com/getgrav/grav-plugin-shortcode-ui/pull/19)\n    * Allow the ability to set an `id=\"\"\"` on tabs [#16](https://github.com/getgrav/grav-plugin-shortcode-ui/pull/16)\n"
                        },
                        "2.2.3": {
                            "date": "03/04/2017",
                            "content": "1. [](#bugfix)\n    * Fixed a `z-index` issue in `AccordionShortcode`\n    "
                        },
                        "2.2.2": {
                            "date": "03/04/2017",
                            "content": "1. [](#bugfix)\n    * Renamed `AccordionShortcode` to avoid conflict with `GravStrap` plugin.\n"
                        },
