                            "date": "09/07/2021",
                            "content": "1. [](#new)\n    * Require **Grav 1.7.0**\n    * Added support for `{% throw 404 'Not Found' %}` from twig template to show the error page\n1. [](#improved)\n    * Do not cache 404 error pages by default\n"
                        },
