                            "content": "1. [](#improved)\n    * Updated core `hightlight.pack.js` to include `SCSS` and `Twig`\n    * Updated styles and fixed a couple that were missing from blueprint due to typos\n    * FlexObjects compatibility: changed references to `Page` class to use `PageInterface`\n"
                        },
                        "1.4.0": {
                            "date": "12/05/2017",
                            "content": "1. [](#new)\n    * Updated `highlight.js` to version 9.12.0 (bariscelik) [#16](https://github.com/getgrav/grav-plugin-highlight/pull/16)\n    * Updated `line-numbers.js` to version 2.1.0 (bariscelik) [#16](https://github.com/getgrav/grav-plugin-highlight/pull/16)\n    * Added line numbers to blueprints for admin plugin control (bariscelik) [#16](https://github.com/getgrav/grav-plugin-highlight/pull/16)\n    * Removed JQuery dependency (bariscelik) [#16](https://github.com/getgrav/grav-plugin-highlight/pull/16)\n"
                        },
                        "1.3.2": {
                            "date": "10/22/2017",
                            "content": "1. [](#new)\n    * Added option for line numbers [#12](https://github.com/getgrav/grav-plugin-highlight/pull/12)\n"
                        },
                        "1.3.1": {
