                    "changelog": {
                        "1.4.0": {
                            "date": "04/29/2026",
                            "content": "1. [](#bugfix)\n    * Fixed PHP 8.1+ deprecation notice \u2014 explicit string casts where `null` was being passed to string-typed function arguments.\n\n1. [](#improved)\n    * Updated bundled `asm89/twig-cache-extension` classes to use Twig namespaced class names (`Twig\\Token`, `Twig\\Environment`, etc.) instead of the legacy `Twig_X` aliases. Now compatible with Twig 1.26+, Twig 2.x, and Twig 3.x \u2014 meaning the plugin works on Grav 1.7 and Grav 2.0 from a single codebase.\n"
                        },
