                            "content": "1. [](#improved)\n  * Use a normal or minified `googlemaps.js` depending on the `debugger.enabled` yaml flag \n  * Add language URL parameter only if language is known\n  * Document the `assets.js('bottom')` issue on not uptodate themes\n\n"
