                        "1.0.0": {
                            "date": "12/15/2025",
                            "content": "1. [](#new)\n    * **Initial Release of Nord Resume**\n    * Complete rebranding to \"Nord Resume\" (slug: `resume-nordic`)\n    * Implemented **Nord Color Palette** with automatic Dark/Light mode detection\n    * Replaced legacy Foundation Icons with local **FontAwesome 7.1.0** assets\n    * Added **Admin Panel Configuration** (blueprints):\n        * Toggle Gravatar & adjust size\n        * Custom footer text\n        * Toggle credits\n    * Refactored templates to remove hardcoded personal data\n    * Fixed HTML rendering in Experience and Interests descriptions\n    * Optimized CSS for better icon alignment (Flexbox)"
                        }
