                "grama": {
                    "name": "Grama",
                    "version": "0.5.4",
                    "description": "A simple multilingual grav theme that doesn&#39;t use any external service and resources from GAFAM or elsewhere",
                    "description_html": "<p>A simple multilingual grav theme that doesn&#39;t use any external service and resources from GAFAM or elsewhere</p>",
                    "description_plain": "A simple multilingual grav theme that doesn&#39;t use any external service and resources from GAFAM or elsewhere",
                    "icon": "space-shuttle",
                    "author": {
                        "name": "Squeak",
                        "url": "https://squeak.eauchat.org",
                        "email": "squeak@eauchat.org"
                    },
                    "dependencies": [
                        {
                            "name": "grav",
                            "version": ">=1.5.10"
                        }
                    ],
                    "homepage": "https://framagit.org/squeak/grama",
                    "keywords": "grama, theme, maghost, modern, fast, responsive, html5, css3",
                    "bugs": "https://framagit.org/squeak/grama/-/issues",
                    "license": "AGPL",
                    "tag_name": "v0.5.4",
                    "date": "2024-06-25T12:31:50Z",
                    "release_type": "stable",
                    "zipball_url": "https://getgrav.org/download/themes/grama/0.5.4",
                    "repository": "https://github.com/eauchat/grama",
                    "slug": "grama",
                    "install_path": "user/themes/grama",
                    "content_sha256": "3a7ade2ec62823f51192ce677544b7c3c834eb31ae4d410ee6ed29b87088cb71",
                    "screenshot": "themes-grama.jpg",
                    "changelog": {
                        "1.2.0": {
                            "date": "2056-07-29",
                            "content": "1. [](#new)\n    * New features added\n    * Another new feature\n2. [](#improved)\n    * Improvement made\n    * Another improvement\n3. [](#bugfix)\n     * Bugfix implemented\n     * Another bugfix -->\n\n"
                        },
                        "0.5.4": {
                            "date": "2024-06-25",
                            "content": "1. [](#improved)\n    * Fixed theme coloring issues, made featherlight use theme color schemes.\n"
                        },
                        "0.5.3": {
                            "date": "2024-06-25",
                            "content": "1. [](#improved)\n    * Added missing piece of documentation for lightbox images titles to work.\n"
                        },
                        "0.5.2": {
                            "date": "2024-06-25",
                            "content": "1. [](#new)\n    * Can now add titles to images in gallery and lightbox.\n"
                        },
                        "0.5.1": {
                            "date": "2024-06-22",
                            "content": "1. [](#new)\n    * Added background-image, background-size, stylesheet and pageStylesheet theme variables, improved default styling of backgrounds.\n2. [](#improved)\n    * Now displays image.meta.alt_text under each image in galleries.\n    * Support having images as menu titles in navbar.\n"
                        },
                        "0.5.0": {
                            "date": "2024-04-20",
                            "content": "1. [](#improved)\n    * Use tag and author taxonomies instead of tags and authors.\n    * Location taxonomy can now be an array.\n    * Added \"credits\" section in README and improved it's content a bit.\n"
                        },
                        "0.4.1": {
                            "date": "2024-04-15",
                            "content": "1. [](#improved)\n    * Added \"no posts\" placeholder for feeds.\n"
                        },
                        "0.4.0": {
                            "date": "2024-04-13",
                            "content": "1. [](#bugfix)\n    * Fixed small styling issues\n2. [](#new)\n    * Made it easy to have elements toggleable by setting classes&attributes in content or from theme/header \"toggleable\" variable (see README for more info on how to use it).\n    * Template name is now also applied as a class to main container, so it can be used for general stylings.\n    * Template name and title (without prefix) are now applied as classes to modular page container element.\n    * Added a default modular template.\n3. [](#improved)\n    * Removed `calendar` template and `post_event` partial, the same functionality is now accessible with blog template and `post_cards_full_width` option (also usable in `tag` and `author` templates).\n"
                        },
                        "0.3.3": {
                            "date": "2024-04-09",
                            "content": "1. [](#bugfix)\n    * Corrected dates in changelog file.\n    * More renaming fixes.\n"
                        },
                        "0.3.2": {
                            "date": "2024-04-08",
                            "content": "1. [](#improved)\n    * The setting \"hide_header_image\" now also affects post pages (not only post cards).\n"
                        },
                        "0.3.1": {
                            "date": "2024-04-06",
                            "content": "1. [](#new)\n    * Made it possible to display tags in post cards.\n2. [](#improved)\n    * Made it possible to customize authors and tag paths/slugs.\n    * Improved documentation.\n    * Small fixes in tag page and tags list. Made it possible to add some text to tag page.\n3. [](#bugfix)\n    * Fixed elements forgotten in renaming process.\n"
                        },
                        "0.3.0": {
                            "date": "2024-04-05",
                            "content": "1. [](#new)\n    * Renamed theme to grama (previously magrav).\n"
                        },
                        "0.2.0": {
                            "date": "2024-04-04",
                            "content": "1. [](#improved)\n    * Blog, calendar and wiki templates will show list of posts from collection if it's set or will default to children pages.\n    * Author avatars now display card and link only if an author page is available.\n    * Make it possible to disable image galleries in posts globally.\n    * Various minor layout improvements.\n2. [](#new)\n    * Simple header is now automatically hidden if empty.\n    * Site author page now also displays all posts without author.\n    * Added possibility to have no side images.\n    * Added possibility to hide author name and thumbnails from post cards and pages.\n    * Added possibility to hide header image in posts pages and cards.\n"
                        },
                        "0.1.4": {
                            "date": "2024-04-01",
                            "content": "1. [](#bugfix)\n    * Fixed misuse of safe_truncate in post and event cards.\n"
                        },
                        "0.1.3": {
                            "date": "2024-04-01",
                            "content": "1. [](#improved)\n    * Make buildDist script log a nice error message if missing lessc dependency\n"
                        },
                        "0.1.2": {
                            "date": "2024-04-01",
                            "content": "1. [](#improved)\n    * Merged whole wiki folder into README file\n"
                        },
                        "0.1.1": {
                            "date": "2024-03-31",
                            "content": "1. [](#new)\n    * Made modular page automatically list children pages\n    * Created blueprint for page template modular\n    * Made modular gallery use default header template for it's header\n    * Added wiki folder explaining how to use and develop grama\n"
                        },
                        "0.1.0": {
                            "date": "2024-03-25",
                            "content": "1. [](#new)\n    * Finished first working version of grama theme\n    * Published theme\n"
                        },
                        "0.0.1": {
                            "date": "2024-02-27",
                            "content": "1. [](#new)\n    * Created grama theme from maghost theme\n    * ChangeLog started..."
                        }
                    },
                    "download": "https://getgrav.org/download/themes/grama/0.5.4"
                },
