                    "description": "uPMORph online soon should be used to either comfort the public until your kickass project/app/product/startup launches (**online soon**),or set your site on maintenance (**_back_ online soon**).",
                    "description_html": "<p>uPMORph online soon should be used to either comfort the public until your kickass project/app/product/startup launches (<strong>online soon</strong>),or set your site on maintenance (<strong><em>back</em> online soon</strong>).</p>",
                    "description_plain": "uPMORph online soon should be used to either comfort the public until your kickass project/app/product/startup launches (online soon),or set your site on maintenance (back online soon).",
                    "icon": "hourglass-half",
                    "author": {
                        "name": "taPMeppe solutions",
                        "url": "https://tapmeppe.solutions",
                        "email": "development@tapmeppe.com"
                    },
                    "dependencies": [
                        {
                            "name": "grav",
                            "version": ">=1.6.0"
                        },
                        {
                            "name": "admin",
                            "version": ">=1.9.0"
                        }
                    ],
                    "homepage": "https://github.com/taPMeppeSols/grav-theme-upmorph-online-soon",
                    "docs": "https://github.com/taPMeppeSols/grav-theme-upmorph-online-soon/blob/master/README.md",
                    "demo": "https://tapmeppe.solutions",
                    "keywords": "grav, theme, tapmeppe, solution, eventually, maintenance, coming-soon, modern, responsive, newsletter, light, lightweight",
                    "bugs": "https://github.com/taPMeppeSols/grav-theme-upmorph-online-soon/issues",
                    "license": "MIT",
                    "tag_name": "v2020.17",
                    "date": "2020-08-09T21:55:39Z",
                    "release_type": "stable",
                    "zipball_url": "https://getgrav.org/download/themes/upmorph-online-soon/2020.17",
                    "repository": "https://github.com/taPMeppeSols/grav-theme-upmorph-online-soon",
                    "slug": "upmorph-online-soon",
                    "install_path": "user/themes/upmorph-online-soon",
                    "content_sha256": "e4dff5054d58a8fc3230f0c3e6d68a68332330a5c2bb10f22497b1c86e468157",
                    "screenshot": "themes-upmorph-online-soon.jpg",
                    "changelog": {
                        "2020.17": {
                            "date": "09.08.2020",
                            "content": "1. [](#improved)\n   * [Edge Chromium](https://www.microsoft.com/edge) has been tested and is now fully supported.\n2. [](#bugfix)\n   * `upmorph-online-soon.php` the trailing comma on line 260 has been removed.\n   * The deprecated function `User::load` has been replaced by the new function used to load user accounts.\n"
                        },
                        "2020.15-16": {
                            "date": "02.03.2020",
                            "content": "1. [](#bugfix)\n   * Creation of the `user-data://upmorph-online-soon` directory during the activation of the theme.\n   * languages/de.yaml, languages/en.yaml, languages/fr.yaml\n\n"
                        },
                        "2020.14": {
                            "date": "01.03.2020",
                            "content": "1. [](#improved)\n   * Global `THEME` object: `{% set THEME = config.theme %}`.\n   * Global `LANG` object: `{% set LANG = html_lang %}`.\n   * Module social networks: the status check has been added.\n2. [](#bugfix)\n   * Module registration: the status check has been added to simplify the deactivation of the module.\n\n"
                        },
                        "2020.13": {
                            "date": "01.03.2020",
                            "content": "1. [](#improved)\n   * languages/fr.yaml\n   * languages/de.yaml\n"
                        },
                        "2020.12": {
                            "date": "29.02.2020",
                            "content": "1. [](#improved)\n   * *.twig: `_self` as been replaced by `import _self as macros`.\n   * upmorph-online-soon.php & *.twig: The GRAV native `page->url` is now used instead of the theme custom route finding algorithm.\n   * base.html.twig: `meta:color-theme` has been added.\n"
                        },
                        "2020.10-11": {
                            "date": "27.02.2020",
                            "content": "1. [](#improved)\n   * Minor improvements\n   * Successful test on the browser: opera\n"
                        },
                        "2020.9": {
                            "date": "08-09.02.2020",
                            "content": "1. [](#improved)\n   * The error logger is now more versatile.\n2. [](#bugfix) \n   * Backend: the registration module now properly shows that an email is already in the list when an opt-in url is used more than once.\n   * Design (CSS): the representation of the modals.\n"
                        },
                        "2020.8": {
                            "date": "08.02.2020",
                            "content": "1. [](#improved)\n   * The *privacy policy* & *imprint* have been added at the foot of the site.\n   * The email deletion action has been added the registration module.\n   * The registration module has been re-written from the procedural approach to a more object oriented one.\n   * The improvement above was necessary to fully embed the registration module in the GRAV life cycle.\n2. [](#bugfix) \n   * Design (CSS): the representation of the site foot on mobile devices.\n"
                        },
                        "2020.6": {
                            "date": "25.01.2020",
                            "content": "1. [](#bugfix) \n   * Minor bug fixes\n"
                        },
                        "2020.5": {
                            "date": "25.01.2020",
                            "content": "1. [](#improved)\n   * The dependency from the plugin 'admin-addon-user-manager' has become optional and no longer mandatory.\n   * An internal simple buffer is now used to speed up multiple access to the list of recipients (users) & pages (routes).\n2. [](#bugfix) \n   * The fields in the registration form on the side now have the same height and the text is placed in the middle.\n"
                        },
                        "2020.4": {
                            "date": "23.01.2020",
                            "content": "1. [](#new)\n   * First release"
                        }
                    },
                    "download": "https://getgrav.org/download/themes/upmorph-online-soon/2020.17"
                },
