                    "screenshot": "themes-grav-coder.jpg",
                    "changelog": {
                        "0.1.12": {
                            "date": "07/16/2026",
                            "content": "1. [](#new)\n    * Add configurable light, dark, and system color schemes.\n    * Add docker based local development setup.\n"
                        },
                        "0.1.11": {
                            "date": "07/05/2026",
                            "content": "1. [](#new)\n    * Verify compatibility against Grav `2.0`.\n"
                        },
                        "0.1.10": {
                            "date": "08/12/2022",
                            "content": "1. [](#new)\n    * _BREAKING CHANGE:_ More flexible fontawesome icons for footer. Please update your theme configuration file in accordance with changes mentioned under [Customizations](https://github.com/ParitoshBh/grav-coder#customizations). Refer to `icon` value. It now needs `fab` prefix. Thanks [@EpicLPer](https://github.com/EpicLPer).\n"
                        },
                        "0.1.9": {
                            "date": "09/23/2021",
                            "content": "1. [](#new)\n    * Add support for `rel: me`. Thanks [@Habmala](https://github.com/Habmala).\n"
                        },
                        "0.1.8": {
                            "date": "12/25/2020",
                            "content": "1. [](#new)\n    * Add support for Grav version `1.7.0`.\n    * Add support for loading jquery debugging. Only enabled when debugging is enabled.\n    * Add option to show login/logout link in navbar.\n    * Show tags (below categories) as part of taxonomy. Thanks [@akisys](https://github.com/akisys).\n1. [](#bugfix)\n    * Attempt to fix navigation on item detail page. Hopefully this time for good.\n"
                        },
                        "0.1.7": {
                            "date": "09/09/2020",
                            "content": "1. [](#bugfix)\n    * Attempt fixing navigation on item detail page [#18](https://github.com/ParitoshBh/grav-coder/issues/18). Thanks [@HymieAli](https://github.com/HymieAli).\n"
                        },
                        "0.1.6": {
                            "date": "12/30/2019",
                            "content": "1. [](#bugfix)\n    * Include host value when building page navigation (newer) slug. Fixes [#16](https://github.com/ParitoshBh/grav-coder/issues/16)\n"
                        },
                        "0.1.5": {
                            "date": "11/21/2019",
                            "content": "1. [](#bugfix)\n    * Include host value when building page navigation slug. Fixes [#16](https://github.com/ParitoshBh/grav-coder/issues/16)\n"
                        },
                        "0.1.4": {
                            "date": "08/22/2019",
                            "content": "1. [](#new)\n    * Highlight selected page in navbar. Thanks [@samuelstein](https://github.com/samuelstein)\n    * Overwrite or extend styles using `custom.css`. Thanks [@samuelstein](https://github.com/samuelstein)\n1. [](#bugfix)\n    * Comma separated categories (on blog entry page). Fixes [#11](https://github.com/ParitoshBh/grav-coder/issues/11)\n"
                        },
                        "0.1.3": {
                            "date": "05/16/2019",
                            "content": "1. [](#new)\n    * Add pagination support.\n"
                        },
                        "0.1.2": {
                            "date": "05/10/2019",
                            "content": "1. [](#new)\n    * Activate category listing url.\n    * Automatically generate copyright year (current year). Add ability to define start year.\n    * Add instructions for setting up homepage, blog listing page and navigation bar menu items.\n1. [](#bugfix)\n    * Use bootstrap btn class for building footer social icons. Fixes issue with using `researchgate` fontawesome icon.\n    * Show page titles correctly.\n"
                        },
                        "0.1.1": {
                            "date": "9/25/2018",
                            "content": "1. [](#new)\n    * Added option to show navigation links (previous/next) on post page (enabled by default), to disable it,\n        ```\n        post:\n            navigation: false\n        ```\n    * Added placeholder image for Grav marketplace!\n"
                        },
                        "0.1.0": {
                            "date": " 08/26/2018",
                            "content": "1. [](#new)\n    * Marketplace release!"
                        }
                    },
                    "download": "https://getgrav.org/download/themes/grav-coder/0.1.12"
                },
