                            "date": "02/15/2021",
                            "content": "1. [](#bugfix)\n    * Revised fix for compatibility issue with Shortcode Gallery++ Plugin (thanks @sal0max)\n"
                        },
                        "2.2.2": {
                            "date": "02/15/2021",
                            "content": "1. [](#bugfix)\n    * Removed compatibility issue with Shortcode Gallery++ Plugin due to unexpected issues on Blog listing page\n"
