                    "description_plain": "Port of Minimaxing by HTML5 UP",
                    "icon": "rebel",
                    "author": {
                        "name": "Hugh Barnes",
                        "email": "dev@hubns.com"
                    },
                    "homepage": "https://github.com/hughbris/grav-theme-minimaxing",
                    "docs": "https://github.com/hughbris/grav-theme-minimaxing/blob/master/README.md",
                    "demo": "https://behold.metamotive.co.nz/minimaxing",
                    "keywords": "grav, theme, html5up, blue",
                    "bugs": "https://github.com/hughbris/grav-theme-minimaxing/issues",
                    "license": "MIT",
                    "tag_name": "v0.3.0",
                    "date": "2024-03-30T21:00:11+13:00",
                    "release_type": "stable",
                    "zipball_url": "https://getgrav.org/download/themes/minimaxing/0.3.0",
                    "repository": "https://github.com/hughbris/grav-theme-minimaxing",
                    "slug": "minimaxing",
                    "install_path": "user/themes/minimaxing",
                    "content_sha256": "a8c4c8388208118032cf2e2a834ebdd401a8f764aaf36c1579126b976e78f887",
                    "screenshot": "themes-minimaxing.jpg",
                    "changelog": {
                        "0.3.0": {
                            "date": "29-03-2024",
                            "content": "1. [](#new)\n    * Add support and an option to use latest jQuery bundled by Grav (d8c404d, 1fb3d6f)\n    * Add blueprints including exciting new setting (fcffe6e)\n    * Show theme version in debugger (deb636c)\n\n1. [](#improved)\n    * Improve docs\n    * Update docs\n    * Clean up, simplify, update Twig\n    * Blog item modules now implemented as invisible child pages ([#2](https://github.com/hughbris/grav-theme-minimaxing/issues/2)) (**potentially breaking**)\n\n1. [](#bugfix)\n    * Correct bad HTML/Twig block nesting (0ea07f5) (**potentially breaking**)\n"
                        },
                        "0.2.6": {
                            "date": "04-02-2024",
                            "content": "1. [](#improved)\n    * Update README about deferred assets (support now required) (feee269) and dropdown menus (a587c96)\n    * Improve blocks\n"
                        },
                        "0.2.5": {
                            "date": "29-05-2021",
                            "content": "1. [](#bugfix)\n    * Add support for custom CSS as per Grav theme conventions ([#6](https://github.com/hughbris/grav-theme-minimaxing/issues/6))\n1. [](#new)\n    * Add basic submenus ([#12](https://github.com/hughbris/grav-theme-minimaxing/issues/12) and probably the mysterious [#8](https://github.com/hughbris/grav-theme-minimaxing/issues/8)) (3339e39b)\n    * Style basic submenus for mobile\n"
                        },
                        "0.2.4": {
                            "date": "28-05-2021",
                            "content": "1. [](#bugfix)\n    * Templates now compatible with Grav 1.7's [Twig autescaping defaults](https://learn.getgrav.org/17/advanced/grav-development/grav-17-upgrade-guide#most-common-issues), mainly by adding raw filter to content and assets\n"
                        },
                        "0.2.3": {
                            "date": " 24-05-2018",
                            "content": "1. [](#improved)\n    * Base template modified so it can be extended to support a deferred asset block ([#9](https://github.com/hughbris/grav-theme-minimaxing/issues/9))\n    * change favicon and cleanup images folder\n\n1. [](#new)\n    * Instructions for deploying deferred asset blocks added to README\n"
                        },
                        "0.2.1": {
                            "date": " 18-02-2018",
                            "content": "1. [](#new)\n    * port of [existing theme](https://html5up.net/minimaxing)\n    * [demo pages](_demo/pages) and an additional [Elements page](_demo/pages/90.elements/onecolumn.md)\n1. [](#improved)\n    * add docs, demo and correct keywords in blueprint\n1. [](#bugfix)\n    * fix twig typo bug in header link\n"
                        }
                    },
                    "dependencies": [],
                    "download": "https://getgrav.org/download/themes/minimaxing/0.3.0"
                },
